          "Build durable service relationships with the renter and non-college-educated majority: these constituencies are often underserved in rural and exurban districts where homeowner interests dominate; a legislator who demonstrates active constituent attention to their specific concerns (housing, workforce development, healthcare access) builds a credible counter to any future opposition.",
          "Treat the 4.4% demographic gap with appropriate attention to constituent service: while smaller than many districts, it still represents several hundred households whose needs and civic participation patterns warrant specific engagement rather than assumption into the broader community narrative."
