          { name: "Partisan Positioning Without Constituent Problem-Solving", tag: "avoid", why: "IA-HD-15 is demographically Republican, but the 31% opposition and the specific economic pressures facing older, fixed-income homeowners mean that generic partisan messaging—without concrete answers to healthcare costs, tax fairness, or rural service delivery—will fail to consolidate the opposition and leave the seat vulnerable to a challenger who addresses these material concerns directly, regardless of partisan affiliation." }
