          "Address the 58.4% college-educated professional constituency's actual priorities: this is a workforce of managers, knowledge workers, and professionals evaluating based on whether government supports their economic advancement — education quality, childcare accessibility, healthcare cost containment, and whether the fiscal environment encourages or constrains professional opportunity.",
