          "Engage the 12-13% Hispanic, Black, and Asian communities with specific constituent service, not generic outreach: in a district this close, the turnout and candidate preference of these populations is decisive, and their economic concerns—job access, healthcare, education quality, housing affordability—overlap substantially with the Anglo majority's but may be underserved by generic partisan messaging.",
