          "Lead with homeowner economic security: property tax burden in the context of $71,204 income, healthcare cost trajectory for a 44.1-year median age constituency approaching Medicare eligibility, and housing affordability for adult children entering the market are the material governance issues that drive voter evaluation in districts with this demographic profile.",
