          "Understand the 31% opposition specifically — whether it reflects young adults and renters frustrated by economic opportunity, agricultural families under commodity-price or cost-of-production stress, or the ~4.5% demographic gap representing communities not captured in the four Census categories; each constituency requires different policy engagement.",
