          "Address property tax burden specifically: at $106,485 income with 29.4% renters and a median age of 33.2, this constituency includes both established homeowners managing tax obligations and young professionals evaluating whether homeownership is economically feasible in this district—property tax policy directly affects both groups' housing economics.",
          "Demonstrate government competence on service delivery, not ideology: this is a constituency that evaluates on whether roads are maintained, local government functions efficiently, and elected officials address practical problems—partisan positioning is secondary to evidence of capable administration.",
          "Engage the 49% Democratic constituency directly on their primary concerns rather than ignoring it: understanding specifically what drove Democratic votes in 2022—whether education funding anxiety, reproductive rights concerns, tax policy objections, or something else—and offering credible answers is more important to holding a 51-49 seat than consolidating only the existing Republican coalition."
