          "Serve the ~3.5% Hispanic, Asian, and other communities with genuine constituent attention: these voters exist in the district even if they do not drive the partisan margin, and their economic concerns around healthcare access, workforce opportunity, and small-business viability deserve specific service rather than invisibility.",
          "Do not campaign this seat as though 69% is permission to ignore opposition voices: the 31% represents voters with real concerns about your record or alternatives; understanding what is driving that 31% and addressing it directly is how a representative keeps a safe seat safe and prevents credible challengers from gaining traction."
